// ================================================================
// CHENNAI MULTI-TEMPORAL LULC PROJECT
// SCRIPT 05E1
//
// 2015 -> 2010 INDEPENDENT VALIDATION TRANSFER QA
//
// PURPOSE
// -------
// Transfer the LOCKED 2015 independent validation reference
// locations toward 2010 using the same cross-sensor philosophy
// used for automated historical training transfer.
//
// IMPORTANT INDEPENDENCE RULE
// ---------------------------
// Validation class signatures are built ONLY from the
// 2015 independent validation reference set.
//
// The FINAL 2010 training asset is used ONLY for:
//     30 m spatial exclusion.
//
// Training is NOT used to define validation spectral signatures.
// Validation is NOT used to modify training.
//
// CROSS-SENSOR LOGIC
// ------------------
// 2015 = Landsat 8 OLI
// 2010 = Landsat 5 TM
//
// Each year is normalized independently:
//
// z ~= (x - median) / (IQR / 1.349)
//
// Then 2010 normalized pixels are evaluated against
// class signatures derived from normalized 2015 validation pixels.
//
// SCREENING THRESHOLDS — LOCKED
// -----------------------------
// own standardized RMS distance <= 1.25
// class separation margin       >= 0.25
// 2010 clear_count              >= 2
// nearest class                 = reference class
// local valid neighbours        >= 5
// local same-class fraction     >= 5/9
//
// Plus:
// 30 m exclusion from FINAL 2010 training.
//
// OUTPUT
// ------
// QA candidate asset:
// chennai_validation_transfer_2015_to_2010_QA_05E1
//
// DO NOT START EXPORT UNTIL CONSOLE QA IS REVIEWED.
//
// ================================================================


